{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And of the blue, and the purple, etc.</b> שֵׁשׁ is not stated here, and from this I say that these garments of שְׂרָד are not priestly garments — for in priestly garments there was שֵׁשׁ — but rather they are garments with which they cover the sacred utensils at the time of setting out on journeys, in which there was no שֵׁשׁ."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:56:50.739528097Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}